# HAT TRICK, 1-10: King Spiker, a big spiker with a crown. It hops at you
# three times, then lobs three spades over in arcs, and round again. A
# kicked ball takes one off it, a driven shot three; beaten, it bursts into
# five spikers' bodies and five drumsticks. The demo player beats it.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat level 10
cheat skipintro
cheat god
expect foes_12 == 1
expect hp_12 == 12
waituntil shots_4 == 3 600
# a kick, then a driven shot
cheat noshots
cheat still
cheat bosspos 180 148
cheat pos 0 100 160
cheat carry 0
wait 2
hold DOWN
press B 1
release
waituntil hp_12 == 11 60
cheat pos 0 100 160
cheat carry 0
wait 2
hold B
wait 40
hold DOWN B
wait 1
release
waituntil hp_12 == 8 60
# and the rest by the demo player, with real presses
cheat unstill
cheat mortal
cheat spare 0 99
botuntil foes == 0 9000
expect falling == 5
waituntil food_item3 >= 1 100
